fn gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_point_x_owner %fn GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedContourEndpointCompletedOwner fn GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedPointXState GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedPointXOwner \endpoint\state:
    GuiFontRegisteredFaceSimpleGlyphIndexedPointXOwner endpoint state

//: predicate が成立した場合だけ typed invalid reason を候補にします。
